  "Rain Sheet Swell mp (one-drum patch, F1 = 41): plays nothing (Kontakt's Voices stays 0, the owner). Its sample group is like Swell mf / f's (8 zones, velocity 1-127, not muted) in this patch, Metal Clangs and the Unpitched - Metal kit, so it's in Spitfire's script, not a missing zone; the kit patch (where it is off by default) is the only other place to try it.",
